  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police cooperation in Rwanda, phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polissamarbete i Rwanda, fas 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A tripartite cooperation programme between the Swedish, Rwandan and South African Police Services for the period 2008-2009. This is the second phase of the programme. The overall objective of the programme is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the Rwanda National Police to deliver quality services to the community as a professional police organisation based on democratic values.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett trepartssamarbete mellan den svenska, rwandiska och sydafrikanska polisen under perioden 2008-2009. Detta &#xE4;r den andra fasen av programmet. Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka den rwandiska polisens institutionallla kapacitet.</narrative>
  </description>
